# Overrides GNU Stow's built-in default ignore list for this package only.
# Same VCS/editor boilerplate as stow's defaults, but WITHOUT \.gitignore —
# unlike stow's default assumption, this package deliberately ships a real
# .gitignore file (stowed to ~/.gitignore) as package content, not as a
# marker to be skipped.
#
# Comments and blank lines are allowed.

RCS
.+,v

CVS
\.\#.+       # CVS conflict files / emacs lock files
\.cvsignore

\.svn
_darcs
\.hg

\.git
\.gitmodules

.+~          # emacs backup files
\#.*\#       # emacs autosave files

^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING
